      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg i think i had an allergic reaction to something i just ate at this new place. my chest and stomach are covered in these red itchy hives and my throat feels kind of tight/weird like i cant swallow perfectly. should i just take a benadryl and wait to see if it goes away or is this bad?? i dont wanna go to the er if i dont have to",
